{"id":"1330938447","kind":"answer","title":"怎样可以让知识点记忆的更加牢固？","author":"Thoughts Memo","original_authors":["Thoughts Memo"],"original_source_urls":[],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"AnkiX高考","date":"2020-07-10","updated":"2020-07-10","votes":92,"comment_count":9,"minutes":2,"chars":786,"keywords":["间隔重复","长期记忆","检索练习","Anki","遗忘曲线"],"summary":"说两点： 以测代看 间隔复习 先说第一点，什么是以测代看？ 即以自测的形式代替看书。 为什么我们要以测代看？ 当我们阅读教科书上的章节，或重新看我们的笔记，我们是以一种 消极 的方式使用材料。 我们以为我们像海绵一样，当信息映入我们的双眼时，我们就能吸收知识。 但是实际上，当我们 积极 地与材料互动，我们才真正在学习。比如我们…","question_detail_html":"<p>很多时候背书什么的都是过段时间就忘，怎么样才能让这些知识点深刻记忆在脑子里？</p>","zhihu_url":"https://www.zhihu.com/question/405857439/answer/1330938447","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"Ve9te1-p\">说两点：</p><ol><li data-pid=\"i7d0VdOA\">以测代看</li><li data-pid=\"9ENycbgj\">间隔复习</li></ol><p data-pid=\"md0GU-I6\">先说第一点，什么是以测代看？</p><p data-pid=\"KStktxvx\">即以自测的形式代替看书。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-295388b628baa6cddb8043e496d8f3c4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-295388b628baa6cddb8043e496d8f3c4_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-295388b628baa6cddb8043e496d8f3c4\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-295388b628baa6cddb8043e496d8f3c4_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"xPSD6alo\">为什么我们要以测代看？</p><p data-pid=\"y-_EnN8F\">当我们阅读教科书上的章节，或重新看我们的笔记，我们是以一种<b>消极</b>的方式使用材料。</p><p data-pid=\"9dnS2i1V\">我们以为我们像海绵一样，当信息映入我们的双眼时，我们就能吸收知识。</p><p data-pid=\"iLsGKzXe\">但是实际上，当我们<b>积极</b>地与材料互动，我们才真正在学习。比如我们会思考这些材料与其他材料有什么联系。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3147fced096d95fcb6349cc239f2bf54_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-5dd9cec789914e6f413b4996de1288fa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-5dd9cec789914e6f413b4996de1288fa_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-default-watermark-src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-3147fced096d95fcb6349cc239f2bf54_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" data-original-token=\"v2-5dd9cec789914e6f413b4996de1288fa\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-5dd9cec789914e6f413b4996de1288fa_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"tc8jLUUv\">再说第二点，什么是间隔复习？</p><p data-pid=\"N3iEt4cA\">即在学习后间隔安排复习任务。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-f608b1513014c70fd9b51ccd1b037eb9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-f608b1513014c70fd9b51ccd1b037eb9_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-f608b1513014c70fd9b51ccd1b037eb9\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-f608b1513014c70fd9b51ccd1b037eb9_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"BuWVlBT_\">为什么我们要间隔复习？</p><p data-pid=\"Ple3iCJZ\">第一天，当我们翻开课本，听老师讲课，学了点东西之后，随着时间推移，我们学到的东西在记忆中的保留量将像<b>遗忘曲线</b>那样指数级<b>下降</b>。</p><p data-pid=\"rKfUMzRb\">在学习新知识之后的这段时间里，我们加入<b>复习</b>(或主动回忆)课堂内容，那么遗忘曲线将会开始<b>变平</b>，然后我们将得到<b>更多更好</b>的<b>长期</b>记忆。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-70f1983f2348b25eab0901c612130131\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-70f1983f2348b25eab0901c612130131_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-70f1983f2348b25eab0901c612130131\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/50/v2-70f1983f2348b25eab0901c612130131_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"vNyLS1Lj\">我们该怎么间隔复习？</p><p data-pid=\"F_C212WO\">根据经验，最好的时机就是在我们学习到新知识后开始<b>遗忘</b>的那一刻。</p><figure data-size=\"normal\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-efd647b5270a2259db5c436b45a91660\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-efd647b5270a2259db5c436b45a91660_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-efd647b5270a2259db5c436b45a91660\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-efd647b5270a2259db5c436b45a91660_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"720\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"6UuoQUMo\">结合以上两点，便能极大地提高记忆知识点的牢固程度。但是。。。</p><p data-pid=\"Mf_kaX1x\">但是要学的知识太多了！而且每个知识都有自己的遗忘曲线，想要去追踪他们的复习时机是很难的。</p><p data-pid=\"SWqgMgug\">有没有自动追踪复习时机，还能实现与材料积极互动的工具呢？</p><p data-pid=\"FIiZFwXV\">有的，Anki 可以做到这一点</p><p data-pid=\"1JRJgd9t\">给一个具体的例子吧！以我高中时使用 Anki 的经历为例：</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-7d6c76590a00da74a9dbb88f3c442566_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"fo4DN715\">这是我的一张生物卡片的学习记录，可以看到这些间隔是由 Anki 的算法计算出来的，可以跟踪这个知识点的遗忘曲线。</p><p data-pid=\"DZA9-m-3\">卡片的内容是下面这个，横线上方为问题，下方为答案，复习的时候 Anki 会先显示问题，等待学习者回忆后再给答案。这就实现了以测代看。</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-6906b0c118366546be1367e4ec9f5045_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"KtKEmEG9\">这张卡片对我来说有点迷惑性，所以我答错了一次，复习了13次，总共花在这张卡片上的复习时间是2分31秒。</p><p data-pid=\"p_duLo6n\">再看看另一张卡片</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pica.zhimg.com/50/v2-44c22d8db759cd09da297744c292a5c7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"1002\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"amWk6fjm\">内容是</p><figure data-size=\"small\"><noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb\" data-original-token=\"v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://pic1.zhimg.com/v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7_r.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></noscript><img class=\"origin_image zh-lightbox-thumb lazy\" data-original-token=\"v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://picx.zhimg.com/50/v2-29aae2ab2b316595b087b75bc7aac4b7_720w.jpg?source=2c26e567\" width=\"908\"/></figure><p data-pid=\"rKw5LMkm\">这张卡片我记得熟，复习5次，仅花了28秒的复习时间。</p><p data-pid=\"wOMVyxMD\">希望对大家有所帮助。</p>","rec_chain":[{"id":"57020308","title":"【理论】Study smarter, NOT longer. 你需要间隔重复！","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":135,"minutes":3,"reason":"本回答Level 3 引用"},{"id":"57113246","title":"【理论】测试效应——什么？考试有助于我的学习？","author":"Osmosis from Elsevier","votes":105,"minutes":2,"reason":"本回答Level 3 引用"}],"rec_bridge":[{"id":"46855765","title":"使用Anki准备大型考试的设置","author":"Anki","votes":41,"minutes":7,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46856037","title":"我要去度假。我可以暂停复习程序吗？","author":"Anki","votes":16,"minutes":2,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"46533104","title":"疑问:Anki 没有向我展示我的所有卡片！","author":"Anki","votes":12,"minutes":11,"reason":"延伸深读 · Anki"},{"id":"6046109771","title":"如何追赶积压的 Anki 复习任务","author":"Soren Bjornstad","votes":209,"minutes":14,"reason":"延伸深读 · Soren Bjornstad"},{"id":"718778050","title":"间隔重复的有效实践","author":"Fernando Borretti","votes":286,"minutes":40,"reason":"延伸深读 · Fernando Borretti"}],"rec_answers":[{"id":"816693595","title":"高中生应该怎样记笔记？需要用什么本子？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":88,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 88 赞同"},{"id":"1571897630","title":"高一生物必修一 满分100 我30多，应该怎样快速提分？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":119,"minutes":2,"reason":"相似问答 · 119 赞同"},{"id":"1285507844","title":"高三生物可以速成吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":27,"minutes":7,"reason":"相似问答 · 27 赞同"},{"id":"2154317714","title":"艾宾浩斯遗忘曲线是指从刚开始背的第五分钟复习一次，还是背完之后的第五分钟复习一次呢？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":15,"minutes":1,"reason":"相似问答 · 15 赞同"},{"id":"1582392918","title":"学习不好要怎么复习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":25,"minutes":5,"reason":"相似问答 · 25 赞同"}]}